{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Player": 43,
    "Toranosuke": 38,
    "Xavier": 115
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7212201",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721220101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721220101": {
            "id": "721220101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "The purification device, backup components, a map of our route, and the data from our beacons...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220102"
            ]
          },
          "721220102": {
            "id": "721220102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "I believe that's everything... Hold on, let me check my memo and see if anything is missing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220103"
            ]
          },
          "721220103": {
            "id": "721220103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Beacon data, route map, backup components, purification device...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220106"
            ]
          },
          "721220106": {
            "id": "721220106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "M—My apologies. This is my first time entering this area. Usually, my realm is logistics and data...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220107"
            ]
          },
          "721220107": {
            "id": "721220107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "And at the most, I would operate machines remotely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220108"
            ]
          },
          "721220108": {
            "id": "721220108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "*sigh* I'm really in over my head this time, it's like... trying to drive a duck up a ramp. Have you ever heard that Liyue saying?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220109"
            ]
          },
          "721220109": {
            "id": "721220109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "It basically means asking someone to do something beyond their ability... Though I'm not sure what's so difficult about getting a duck up a ramp.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220110"
            ]
          },
          "721220110": {
            "id": "721220110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Ah, ducks, such elegant, gentle creatures. The sight of them gliding silently along the mirror-sheen waters of Fontaine comes to mind most strikingly at this moment...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220111"
            ]
          },
          "721220111": {
            "id": "721220111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Ugh, alright, let's go. If this device works normally, it should be able to constantly purify the Tatarigami energy in a small area around it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220112"
            ]
          },
          "721220112": {
            "id": "721220112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "This way, we should be able to enter the disaster zone together. We'll stick to our previous plan: you deal with the Fatui and I'll deal with the Mikage Furnace... Let's go."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7212202",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xavier",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
