    {
      "subId": "7212205",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the components back to Xavier",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721220501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721220501": {
            "id": "721220501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Ah, you're back. Have you found all the components?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220502"
            ]
          },
          "721220502": {
            "id": "721220502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I did."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7212222",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xavier",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721221301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721221301": {
            "id": "721221301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Bravo! Right, I shall repair it immediately. Let me see, this component goes here..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7212206",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xavier",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721220601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721220601": {
            "id": "721220601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "That should do the trick. Phew... Let's continue onward. I know of a spot that shall be most ideal for our \"final check.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220603",
              "721220606"
            ]
          },
          "721220603": {
            "id": "721220603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "This is both the key step, and our proudest moment as a team!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220604"
            ]
          },
          "721220604": {
            "id": "721220604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Any product must undergo a final phase of tests before it can be released into the market.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220607"
            ]
          },
          "721220607": {
            "id": "721220607",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "I mean, those few components did come loose earlier. If we don't check the device again, I cannot help but feel uneasy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220608"
            ]
          },
          "721220608": {
            "id": "721220608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Alright. Let's proceed, shall we?"
          },
          "721220606": {
            "id": "721220606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Haha, I suppose you aren't familiar with our work flow. This is how we take responsibility for the quality of our products."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7212207",
      "subQuestName": "Go deeper into the Mikage Furnace",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721220701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721220701": {
            "id": "721220701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Nothing dropped this time, right? Okay, good, it seems not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220702"
            ]
          },
          "721220702": {
            "id": "721220702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This is where we're conducting our \"final check\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220703"
            ]
          },
          "721220703": {
            "id": "721220703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Indeed, this is the place. Let's turn our purification device up to full strength right here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220704"
            ]
          },
          "721220704": {
            "id": "721220704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "However, I must warn you that it can get just a teensy bit noisy when operating at full power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220705"
            ]
          },
          "721220705": {
            "id": "721220705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "I believe that this might displease our Fatui friends around the Mikage Furnace ever so slightly... Do you understand what I mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220708"
            ]
          },
          "721220708": {
            "id": "721220708",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Indeed! An excellent division of labor. Now, allow me to start it up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220709"
            ]
          },
          "721220709": {
            "id": "721220709",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Let the final check begin!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7212208",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xavier",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7212209",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the Fatui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721220901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721220901": {
            "id": "721220901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "This is the spot. The part of the Mikage Furnace that stores the core is right above us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220902"
            ]
          },
          "721220902": {
            "id": "721220902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "My data also indicates that the concentration of Tatarigami here is also the highest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220903"
            ]
          },
          "721220903": {
            "id": "721220903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "As long as this area can be settled, the Mikage Furnace's systems can start running again, which will return everything to normal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220904"
            ]
          },
          "721220904": {
            "id": "721220904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Finally, we're at this step. I must say, I'd quite have liked to use my Film Kamera to record our actions here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220905"
            ]
          },
          "721220905": {
            "id": "721220905",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's a shame that you can't.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220906"
            ]
          },
          "721220906": {
            "id": "721220906",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "It's alright. I can find some people to re-enact the events that transpired here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220907"
            ]
          },
          "721220907": {
            "id": "721220907",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "The name of this film... Hmm. Now I've heard that Inazumans often call their stories \"something-something-Tales.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220908"
            ]
          },
          "721220908": {
            "id": "721220908",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "As such, a fitting name for this film would be...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220909"
            ]
          },
          "721220909": {
            "id": "721220909",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"Tatara Tales.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220910"
            ]
          },
          "721220910": {
            "id": "721220910",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Bravo! Yes, \"Tatara Tales\" it shall be!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220911"
            ]
          },
          "721220911": {
            "id": "721220911",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Alright then. You know the drill, Traveler...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220912"
            ]
          },
          "721220912": {
            "id": "721220912",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll handle the Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220913"
            ]
          },
          "721220913": {
            "id": "721220913",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "And I'll deal with the Mikage Furnace.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220914"
            ]
          },
          "721220914": {
            "id": "721220914",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Hahaha, this exchange between us will surely become an iconic moment in the film.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220915"
            ]
          },
          "721220915": {
            "id": "721220915",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Well, start the device once you're ready. Then, let us give \"Tatara Tales\" the perfect ending it deserves!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7212210",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xavier",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721220805"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721220805": {
            "id": "721220805",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "*cough* Those lawless lunatics! Try them in court, I say! Try them!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220807",
              "721220809"
            ]
          },
          "721220807": {
            "id": "721220807",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "A... a most safe spot... *cough*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220811"
            ]
          },
          "721220811": {
            "id": "721220811",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "But let's get back on topic. According to the data that the beacon in my hand just gathered, the energy level in this area has fallen greatly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220812"
            ]
          },
          "721220812": {
            "id": "721220812",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Based on the current state of our device and its performance, I would say it passes the final check.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220813"
            ]
          },
          "721220813": {
            "id": "721220813",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Now, we can truly get down to business. Come, let's head to the spot where the real work can begin. It's time to finish this."
          },
          "721220809": {
            "id": "721220809",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "*cough* Of course. Forget fighting these villains. I would prefer to use the law as my weapon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721220810"
            ]
          },
          "721220810": {
            "id": "721220810",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "After all, not everyone is so well-versed in martial arts that they may solve... difficult problems the way that you do."
          }
        }
      }
    },
