    {
      "subId": "7212215",
      "subQuestName": "Activate the Purification Device",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721221501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721221501": {
            "id": "721221501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Toranosuke",
            "text": "The Mikage Furnace is back to normal already, huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221502"
            ]
          },
          "721221502": {
            "id": "721221502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Oh, you already know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221503"
            ]
          },
          "721221503": {
            "id": "721221503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Toranosuke",
            "text": "Your deeds at the Mikage Furnace have already been reported to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221505",
              "721221507"
            ]
          },
          "721221505": {
            "id": "721221505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Toranosuke",
            "text": "I cannot take any action without orders from Sir Hanbei.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221508"
            ]
          },
          "721221508": {
            "id": "721221508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Alright, alright. I imagine that our good man here must have his fair share of troubles, what with having a superior who values rigorous process so highly and all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221509"
            ]
          },
          "721221509": {
            "id": "721221509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "What's more, I suspect that our previous actions only went over so smoothly due to the aid of this Mr. Hanbei.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221510"
            ]
          },
          "721221510": {
            "id": "721221510",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "And of course, it's not as if this soldier was of no help to us at all. After all, those few doors...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221511"
            ]
          },
          "721221511": {
            "id": "721221511",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Toranosuke",
            "text": "Thank you for your help, Mr. Xavier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221512"
            ]
          },
          "721221512": {
            "id": "721221512",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "*cough* Well, it was mainly the work of this Traveler. If not for them, I doubt that I would have achieved anything at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221513"
            ]
          },
          "721221513": {
            "id": "721221513",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Toranosuke",
            "text": "Is that so...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221514"
            ]
          },
          "721221514": {
            "id": "721221514",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Toranosuke",
            "text": "Thank you, Traveler. I... apologize for my previous attitude towards you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221515"
            ]
          },
          "721221515": {
            "id": "721221515",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Toranosuke",
            "text": "Thank you, again, for protecting this island."
          },
          "721221507": {
            "id": "721221507",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Toranosuke",
            "text": "I cannot take any action without orders from Sir Hanbei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7212216",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xavier",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721221007"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721221007": {
            "id": "721221007",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "It's... it's finally over... The Mikage Furnace should have resumed operation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221008"
            ]
          },
          "721221008": {
            "id": "721221008",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Let's head to the top and see what the situation is like."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7212211",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the top of the Mikage Furnace",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721221101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721221101": {
            "id": "721221101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "The Tatarigami here has thinned out so much as to be harmless. Looks like the Mikage Furnace is back in business!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221102"
            ]
          },
          "721221102": {
            "id": "721221102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "If those Fatui want to get their hands on the Tatarigami energy, then the only way they can do it now is to use those cannons to fire on the Mikage Furnace directly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221103"
            ]
          },
          "721221103": {
            "id": "721221103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "But since that would be tantamount to an act of war, I doubt they would do it, no matter how insane they might be.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221108",
              "721221106"
            ]
          },
          "721221108": {
            "id": "721221108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Regardless, the Mikage Furnace is safe for now, so neither we nor this island's treasures are about to get blown sky-high any time soon."
          },
          "721221106": {
            "id": "721221106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "I suppose you refer to those incidents in Liyue and Mondstadt?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721221107"
            ]
          },
          "721221107": {
            "id": "721221107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "I personally feel that given the Mikage Furnace's value, I doubt that it would be worth it for them to resort to such drastic measures."
          }
        }
      }
    },
